<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:20:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Drives Biggest Stock Gain Since 2024 With Rare Midday Vow&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kospi 溃败导致韩国养老基金资产损失 1,510 亿美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets</link><description>由于股市下跌侵蚀了今年早些时候积累的部分巨额收益，韩国国家养老金管理局第三季度资产缩水约 202 万亿韩元（合 1,514 亿美元）。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets'&gt;Kospi 溃败导致韩国养老基金资产损失 1,510 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kospi Rout Wipes $151 Billion From Korea Pension Fund’s Assets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:53:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢旺达凭借旅游业赢得 F1 主办权（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/rwanda-wins-f1-hosting-rights-in-bet-on-tourism-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/rwanda-wins-f1-hosting-rights-in-bet-on-tourism-video'&gt;卢旺达凭借旅游业赢得 F1 主办权（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rwanda Wins F1 Hosting Rights in Bet on Tourism&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/rwanda-wins-f1-hosting-rights-in-bet-on-tourism-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:54:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>俄罗斯因炼油厂遇袭将航空燃油出口禁令延长至游行</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks</link><description>由于乌克兰继续袭击该国的炼油厂，俄罗斯将大多数航空燃油出口禁令延长了四个月，直至三月份，以保持国内市场供应。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks'&gt;俄罗斯因炼油厂遇袭将航空燃油出口禁令延长至游行&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russia Extends Jet Fuel Export Ban to March on Refinery Attacks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:54:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging Stocks Head for Biggest Weekly Gain Since June&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>